.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt MMAP_FILENAME 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mmap_filename
.Nd get the filename corresponding to a mapped memory address
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In buffer.h
.In stralloc.h
.Ft int
.Fn mmap_filename "void *map" "stralloc *sa"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn mmap_filename
function queries the system mapping tables to find the filename backing the memory address
.Fa map ,
storing the path in
.Fa sa .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns non-zero on success, or 0 if the mapping filename could not be resolved.